emscripten: Linux's errno codes.

Its libc is musl's, with Linux's codes: those of macOS and FreeBSD only
(EPWROFF, EDOOFUS...) are unavailable, as on Linux.

--- a/unix/unix_errno_util.c
+++ b/unix/unix_errno_util.c
@@
-#define LINUX defined(__linux__)
+#define LINUX (defined(__linux__) || defined(__EMSCRIPTEN__))
